     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Dear all.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">I have graph plotting issues.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">One is about Item Trace lines, the other issue is Item Information Trace Lines </p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-tLcvG6Uw_v8/U6Op_hgH7cI/AAAAAAAAAPg/5hAFnZBbyFs/s1600/iti.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-tLcvG6Uw_v8/U6Op_hgH7cI/AAAAAAAAAPg/5hAFnZBbyFs/s1600/iti.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476182617000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0gVsBfIG0fheppMnyRzBlM\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-tLcvG6Uw_v8/U6Op_hgH7cI/AAAAAAAAAPg/5hAFnZBbyFs/s1600/iti.png\" border=\"0\"></a><br>&lt;Figure 1&gt; Item trace lines</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">1. Why order sequence were numbered 1 -&gt; 10 -&gt; 11 -&gt; 12 -<span>&gt; ...</span> -&gt; 2 -&gt; 20 -&gt; 21 -<span>&gt; ...</span> 3 -&gt; 30 in Figure 1?</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Normally, <span>order</span> sequence can be numbered 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, ... , 10, 11?</p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-53wG6hSyn0k/U6OqWA9M2GI/AAAAAAAAAPo/Gg9L1kMQ4w0/s1600/iit.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-53wG6hSyn0k/U6OqWA9M2GI/AAAAAAAAAPo/Gg9L1kMQ4w0/s1600/iit.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792476182617000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0be0LwcahMMtG1yaQ14Dkt\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-53wG6hSyn0k/U6OqWA9M2GI/AAAAAAAAAPo/Gg9L1kMQ4w0/s1600/iit.png\" border=\"0\"></a><br>&lt;Figure 2&gt; Item Information Trace Lines</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">2. In Figure 2, I cannot know the variable&#39;s name. What is Item 1 in <span>variable&#39;s name</span>?</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">Cheers,</p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span>Seongho</span> Bae.</p></div>"
    ]
